e hoping to get a harvest soon  we haven't gotten a harvest yet but  we've got our little bears ready to go  as soon as as soon as we're told we can  harvest we don't want to take any out  that they need so it's all the excess  honey as well yeah or not  they're in the beekeeping suit I take it  that we have someone who does it very  very daunting task what else do you  think people need to understand you are  actually there and occupying a place  that very few people will ever see and I  wonder what it is not just the physical  space itself but the role itself you  think that will help people understand  what it's really like to be the vice  president what it's really like to be  the family of the vice president yeah I  mean I think I mean I think well like I  was kind of saying before you know we  won't always be in this role and so I  think that's always an important thing  to remember to kind of take advantage of  it at the time have fun with it you know  keep communicating with one another and  staying close and yeah I think that's  that's what I would say I mean I think  it's um it's like Charlotte said it's  we're only there for a short time and so  while we're there we want to do what we  can to help people as much as we can and  I think maybe that's something that  maybe we didn't understand coming into  it what what it would mean because you  sort of feel like well I'm just caring  pence what can I do but knowing that if  I get behind an issue it does elevate it  if I step up and encourage people it  does mean a lot if we have military  families come to the house swim in the  pool which we've done it means a lot to  them and so I think trying to take  advantage of all of those opportunities  is is something we really work hard at  final question then given what you just  spelled out in this platform that you  both have what's next  hmm well you know what next for me is  I'm gonna start focusing a lot more on  military spouses I feel like our  military spou